+# Fork extension
+
+Add this extension to the agent directory's `settings.json`:
+
+```json
+{
+  "extensions": ["/absolute/path/to/pi/packages/coding-agent/examples/extensions/fork/index.ts"]
+}
+```
+
+The `fork` tool accepts `{ "task": "..." }`. It starts a separate pi process with a snapshot of the current conversation, using the parent's model, thinking level, agent directory, and settings. The process writes a linked session file in the parent's session directory. Its final answer or failure appears in the parent session as a visible `fork-result` message. Running forks stop when the parent session ends.
